        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yonasani kūngunīja Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yonasani, na a batūmami bakwe, gīkī bamūlage ū Daūdi. Alīyo ū Yonasani īkī walī antogilwe ū Daūdi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūng'hūgūla ūng'wīla, “Ū baba akūkoobaga ng'wanya gwa kūkūbūlaga, na lūūlū ilang'hanage. Ī ntondo ī dilū ūlaaje hanhū ūkibise wikale kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakūfuma nū baba naje nakīmīīle nang'hwe hihī nī lipandī īlo ūkwibisīla, nahooye nang'hwe ī mihayo yako; hanuma nakūkūwīla ūmo alahayīle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūhooya ng'hana nū ise ū Saulo, mihayo ya kūnkumīlīja ū Daūdi; ūhaya, “Ū ntemi atizagūng'wītīla mhayo gwabūbi gīko ū ntūmami wakwe ū Daūdi, nguno ataalī kūkūkenya mhayo gose gose. Ī yose īyo akwītaga īkūkwenhelaga solobo nhaale bebe ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwene walībūlagaga ī Līfilisiti walī wifunya gete ū būpanga wakwe; ū SEEBA ūbabeegeja būtindi būtaale no a Baisilaeli, nū bebe ūbona ūyega na kayegele kataale. Ī gīsī lūūlū mhayo kī ūyo gūlīkwenheleja ūng'wītīle būbi būtaale gīko munhū wa mhola gītī Daūdi, ūmūlage nū mhayo ndūhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūng'wigwa ū Yonasani, ūng'wilahīlīla alīhaya, “Nalīkwilahīlīla kūlī SEEBA mpanga, gīkī ū Daūdi atūūbūlagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Yonasani ūng'witana ū Daūdi ūng'wīla pyī īyo bakīhooyela, hūna ūng'wenha nū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Saulo, wandya hangī kwīyolecha ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Saulo gīt'ūmo wītīlaga na kale dūhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūgema hangī kūmūlaga Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla wabūūka būlūgū hangī na a Bafilisiti, ū Daūdi ūja kwilwisha nabo, ūbabūlaga bingī no, abo bakasaaga būpeela nhambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò ū Saulo walī igashije mu kaya yakwe n'ichimu lyakwe mu nkono, kwimanīla gwang'wizīīla moyo gwabūbi kūfuma kūlī SEEBA; ū Daūdi wandya kūtūla ndono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Saulo ūmponegeja ichimu ū Daūdi gīkī anchime līkakūbanīje na ndugu, ūliiliga lyūkalya ndugu ī lichimu; ūpeela ū Daūdi ūjimīīla īkī yalī būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūtūma banhū ū kū ng'wa Daūdi baje bakalang'hane hoi, balamūlage ī dilū ūlū wela. Alīyo ū Mikali ū nke wakwe ū Daūdi, ūng'hūgūla alīng'wīla, “Ūlū ūtapeelile ū būjikū wenūbū, ī ntondo ūkūbūlagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Mikali ūnsheepeleja h'idilisha ū Daūdi, ūneka ūja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Mikali ng'wenūyo ūtūūla lī shiikolile a ha būlīīlī, ūlīkumba ng'wenda, ūlītūūlīkīja na booya wa mbūli ū kū ntwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho watūma banhū gīkī bakandiime ū Daūdi, ū Mikali ūhaya, “Alīsaata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Saulo ūbakomeleja a banhū benabo alībawīla, “Jagi mūkamūūkīje ū mu būlīīlī wakwe mung'wenhe aha nize namūlage.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū benabo aho baashika ho, būsanga līshiikolile a ha būlīīlī, na booya wa mbūli ū kū ntwe gwalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū Mikali, “Bebe nibūlī wanilemba ūntolocha ū ng'wanishi wane ūpīla?” Ū Mikali ūnshokeja alīhaya, “Walī waniwīla, ‘Nilekage naje, nibūlī nose nakūbūlage?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūhanga alī dūūhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wapeela, ūja Lama kūlī Sang'weli, ūūkang'wīla pyī ī mihayo īyo walī wītīlwa na Saulo. Hūna ūja hamò nū Sang'weli būūkalenda Nayoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūtwalīlwa mhola ja gīīkī, “Ū Daūdi alī Nayoti ya Lama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūma banhū baje ko bakandiime. Alīyo aho baashika ko, būbona'ibbipi lya bahangī bakūhangaga, nū Sang'weli wīmīīlaga hamò nabo akūbatongeelaga. Ū Moyo o ng'wa Mulungu ūbizīīla a banhū ba ng'wa Saulo, nabo bandya kūhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho wawīlwa ūtūma banhū bangī, nabo būūkahanga. Ū Saulo ūtūma banhū lūkangala lwa kadatū, alīyo nabo būūkahanga gīko dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ūbona wibūūkīīle wei ng'wenekīlī, wahayūshika kwilambo lya Seku, ūbūūja gīkī, “A ba Sang'weli nū Daūdi ni balī halī?” Būng'wīla, “Balī Nayoti ya Lama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū wihuuta ajile ī Nayoti ya Lama; alīyo ū Moyo o ng'wa Mulungu ūng'wizīīla nū wei aho alī mu nzīla ajile, wandya kūhanga kūshisha ūshika ko ī Nayoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ūūkazuula nī shizwalo shakwe, ūhanga nang'hwe alī ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Sang'weli. Ū lūshikū lwenūlo ūlocha alambalalile alī dūūhū, nū būjikū ūbūkeeyula alī gīko dūhū; h'īchene a banhū bakibūjaga bakūhayaga, “Ū Saulo nang'hwe alī ūmò wa bahangi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
